# Architecture boundaries (scripts/check-architecture.sh).
# Format: <name>|<paths>|<extended regex>|<message>
# A match of the regex in any of the (space-separated) paths is a violation.
# The message is everything after the last `|`, so it must not contain one.
#
# Examples:
# raw database client|src|new[[:space:]]+Pool[[:space:]]*\(|Use the repository layer, not a hand-built client.
# env outside config|src/api src/domain|process\.env|Read configuration in src/config and inject it.
